  "goodToKnow": "Alleinerziehend means raising children alone: eine alleinerziehende Mutter, ein alleinerziehender Vater. Der/die Alleinerziehende is a single parent, an adjectival noun. About one in five families with children in Germany is a single-parent family, and around 80 percent of single parents are mothers. They get a tax allowance and can claim Unterhaltsvorschuss (state advance on child support) from the Jugendamt if the other parent doesn't pay."
